  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For whatever reason, plane colliders are not whitelisted with dynamic bone, which means if you want your bones to collide with the floor, you have to make a gigantic sphere under the ground to simulate a flat surface.  \n\nUnless sphere to plane collisions are significantly more expensive to compute (and looking at the math that doesn't appear to be the case), I see no reason for plane colliders to be disabled.",
